WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:07,990
You're going to eat too, thank you

2
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:27,810
Go in and find that thing for me

3
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:32,890
I see you want to put him away. Look.

4
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:38,060
Don’t think it’s a big deal just because you found a contract.

5
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:40,020
If the person who found the contract dies

6
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,060
The fruits of his labor

7
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,500
Can others occupy it?

8
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,980
You'll know once you try it

9
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,220
you want to help him

10
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,500
Then you go in

11
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:51,820
Otherwise, he won’t be able to think about getting better in the next few days.
